! Silicon, thirty-two atoms: the cubic cell of si8-1k.in stacked four deep.
!
! Twice si16-1k.in -- 128 electrons, 64 bands -- in a tetragonal cell with
! c/a = 4, built by the same rule that made si16 from si8.
!
! **The energy per atom is NOT the same as si16's here, and that is sampling
! rather than a bad cell.** Doubling along z halves the zone along kz, so one
! k-point of this cell folds *two* of si16's -- k_z and k_z + 1/2 -- and a
! single-k run therefore samples a different set of states. Measured: si8 and
! si16 agree on E/atom to 4.3e-7 Ry at their shared k-point and this cell is
! 4.3e-6 away, which is that folding and not a defect. The cell was verified two
! ways instead: every atom is 4-coordinated at exactly the diamond bond length
! (a*sqrt(3)/4), and **si32 at Gamma reproduces si16 sampled at {Gamma,
! (0,0,1/2)} to 8.9e-16 Ry/atom**, which is the folding identity made exact.
!
! Added 2026-08-25 for the GPU work. The largest case in this directory:
! 32 atoms at a production cutoff, ~11800 plane waves and 64 bands. It exists
! to answer two things a smaller cell cannot -- whether the GPU's advantage
! keeps growing with the cell, and whether the 2.6e-09 Ry the batched band
! dial showed on si16-1k-ecut30 grows with it too.
!
! Single k-point, like every other file here, and for the same reason: both
! codes parallelise over k, so a multi-k comparison measures batching rather
! than the cost of the physics.
 &control
    calculation = 'scf'
 /
 &system
    ibrav=6, celldm(1) =10.20, celldm(3) =4.0,
    nat=32, ntyp=1,
    ecutwfc=30.0
 /
 &electrons
    conv_thr = 1.0d-10
 /
ATOMIC_SPECIES
 Si  28.086  Si.pz-vbc.UPF
ATOMIC_POSITIONS crystal
 Si  0.00000  0.00000  0.00000
 Si  0.00000  0.50000  0.12500
 Si  0.50000  0.00000  0.12500
 Si  0.50000  0.50000  0.00000
 Si  0.25000  0.25000  0.06250
 Si  0.25000  0.75000  0.18750
 Si  0.75000  0.25000  0.18750
 Si  0.75000  0.75000  0.06250
 Si  0.00000  0.00000  0.25000
 Si  0.00000  0.50000  0.37500
 Si  0.50000  0.00000  0.37500
 Si  0.50000  0.50000  0.25000
 Si  0.25000  0.25000  0.31250
 Si  0.25000  0.75000  0.43750
 Si  0.75000  0.25000  0.43750
 Si  0.75000  0.75000  0.31250
 Si  0.00000  0.00000  0.50000
 Si  0.00000  0.50000  0.62500
 Si  0.50000  0.00000  0.62500
 Si  0.50000  0.50000  0.50000
 Si  0.25000  0.25000  0.56250
 Si  0.25000  0.75000  0.68750
 Si  0.75000  0.25000  0.68750
 Si  0.75000  0.75000  0.56250
 Si  0.00000  0.00000  0.75000
 Si  0.00000  0.50000  0.87500
 Si  0.50000  0.00000  0.87500
 Si  0.50000  0.50000  0.75000
 Si  0.25000  0.25000  0.81250
 Si  0.25000  0.75000  0.93750
 Si  0.75000  0.25000  0.93750
 Si  0.75000  0.75000  0.81250
K_POINTS
  1
   0.250000  0.250000  0.250000   1.00
